e-planar-exponential-first-passage-limit-shape-September-24-2026.html#thm:exponential-shape","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:ce7743750ae1474f4589c2673deaed744278041b34eea583c42c9901bf74ed1d","file":"preprints/Strict-convexity-and-differentiability-of-the-planar-exponential-first-passage-limit-shape-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":21,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2fa15ff9fce68d9d1154504c5361cc389ed3644b8699b64337330f1fde2e07f4","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Strict-convexity-and-differentiability-of-the-planar-exponential-first-passage-limit-shape-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:ce7743750ae1474f4589c2673deaed744278041b34eea583c42c9901bf74ed1d","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Strict-convexity-and-differentiability-of-the-planar-exponential-first-passage-limit-shape-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L21"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:exponential-shape}\nFor independent exponential edge weights of any rate $\\lambda>0$,\nthe norm $\\mu$ is Fr\\'echet differentiable on $\\R^2\\setminus\\{0\\}$,\nand its unit ball is strictly convex. In particular,\n\\[\n \\mu((1-t)x+ty)<1\n \\quad\\text{if }x,y\\in\\partial\\Bcal,\\ x\\ne y,\\ 0<t<1,\n\\]\nand $\\partial\\Bcal$ is a $C^1$ curve with a unique supporting line\nat every point."}
